# AI agent working files — ephemeral planning docs, not part of the source record
PLAN.md
CONTEXT.md
PROMPTS.md
# ...but a work order's execution trail is the source record, not an ephemeral
# planning doc. core.ignorecase=true on macOS makes CONTEXT.md above match
# .sw-factory/<WO>/context.md, which silently dropped the one file that records
# which requirements and blueprints govern a work order.
!.sw-factory/**/context.md
.agents/
skills-lock.json

